 Quot.sound]
AEGIS.CvSResidualCertificateV1.residual_entry_le : ∀ (x y e r : ℝ), |e| ≤ r → x * y * e ≤ r * (x ^ 2 + y ^ 2) / 2
AEGIS.CvSResidualCertificateV1.abs_sub_le_of_enclosure : ∀ (a c lo hi : ℝ),
